the [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]task. This works for single tasks, `^prj` tasks, counted sessions [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]and Task Link sessions, and every write is a guarded, logged, [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]one-undo edit.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]5[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]5[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202609/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]priority_roll_decay.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202609/priority_roll_decay.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-34[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-34/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Navigation Hotkeys: decay config, Schedule Log roll streak, [/bold #D7AFFF]  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]and pure recommendation planner[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]decay-core[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]decay-core: add the `decay`/`rolls` config grammar, the roll-streak [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]reader with its entry classification, the date roll that avoids the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]current date, the recommendation planner, the decay and cancel reason [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]formatters, and the preview model. Includes a new conformance test file.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]No UI changes.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Navigation Hotkeys: Ctrl+Enter recommended roll for single and[bold black on #FFD75F][/bold #D7AFFF] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]^prj tasks[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]picker-single[dim] · [dim][/dim]after decay-core[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]picker-single: add the roll preview line on the `scheduled` row, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Ctrl+Enter in both picker stages, and Ctrl+R re-roll in stage one. The [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]value stage's pinned row shares the previewed date. Writes are guarded [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and re-verified for roll, decay and cancel, with decay-aware notice [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]cards, CSS, a manifest bump and a vault deploy.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Navigation Hotkeys: recommended roll for counted [/bold #D7AFFF]             [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]N<Ctrl+Shift+P> sessions[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]picker-counted[dim] · [dim][/dim]after picker-single[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]picker-counted: plan a recommendation for each target, show a batch [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]preview line, and compose the cancel and set-priority plans into one [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]undoable editor transaction. Also adds the priorityValueByLine and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]reasonByLine planner extensions, the batch notice card, and a manifest [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]bump.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Navigation Hotkeys: recommended roll for Task Link sessions[/bold #D7AFFF]   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]picker-links[dim] · [dim][/dim]after picker-counted[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]picker-links: read each linked task's streak from its own note and reuse[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the composed batch planner for each note group. Commits go through [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]commitLinkPickerNoteWrites with one shared Pomodoro prune and dependent [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]recovery for cancelled tasks. Also bumps the manifest.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob-cli docs, config guard test, and chezmoi config for roll [/bold #D7AFFF] [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]decay[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]decay-docs[dim] · [dim][/dim]after picker-links[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]decay-docs: add the bob-cli docs/projects.md section, the reason-table [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]rows, and notes in randomize.md and freshness.md. Also adds a Rust test [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]that keeps `decay`/`rolls` keys parseable, and a commented `decay` block[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]in the chezmoi-managed config.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-34","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-34.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-ffbf13dd4ce0ba0e1fb160f0ecc946c1","started_at":"2026-10-01T03:58:31.025463+00:00","state":"active"}],"schema_version":2,"structural_ancestors":["bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-34","bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-34.1","bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-34.2","bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-34.3","bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-34.4","bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-34.5","bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-34.land"]}
